 fts__notice">Up to 24 files. Images: JPEG/PNG/WebP up to 10 MB. Videos: MP4/MOV/WebM up to 50 MB and about 20 seconds. The listing remains pending until FabricTrad approval.</div><div class="fts__wide fts__actions"><button class="fts__primary" type="submit">Submit listing for approval</button><button id="fts-product-reset" class="fts__secondary" type="button">Clear</button></div></form><aside class="fts__ai-box"><div class="fts__cardhead"><div><h3>AI catalogue assistant</h3><p>Paste a product description or supplier message.</p></div></div><textarea id="fts-ai-text" placeholder="Example: Premium pure cotton shirting, 58 inch width, 140 GSM, blue checks, ₹210 per metre, 600 metres in stock, MOQ 5 metres…"></textarea><button id="fts-ai-analyze" class="fts__primary" type="button" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px">Organise product details</button><p style="margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:9px;line-height:1.5">AI only organises information you provide. Review every field before submission.</p></aside></div></section>
