<section data-panel="analytics" hidden><div class="fts__pagehead"><div><h1>Analytics</h1><p>Sales, orders and catalogue performance from your FabricTrad records.</p></div></div><div id="fts-analytics-stats" class="fts__stats"></div><div class="fts__grid2"><article class="ft-shopify-card fts__card"><div class="fts__cardhead"><h2>Sales by status</h2></div><div id="fts-sales-bars" class="fts__chartbars"></div></article><article class="ft-shopify-card fts__card"><div class="fts__cardhead"><h2>Stock by category</h2></div><div id="fts-category-bars" class="fts__chartbars"></div></article></div></section>
<section data-panel="fulfillment" hidden><div class="fts__pagehead"><div><h1>Shipments</h1><p>Shiprocket dispatch and tracking records. Courier creation remains server-controlled.</p></div><button id="fts-toggle-shipment" class="fts__primary">Create shipment</button></div><form id="fts-shipment-form" class="ft-shopify-card fts__card fts__form three" hidden style="margin-bottom:12px"><label>Paid Shopify order<select name="order_id" id="fts-shipment-order" required></select></label><label>Length cm<input name="length" type="number" min="1" max="200" step="0.1" value="30" required></label><label>Breadth cm<input name="breadth" type="number" min="1" max="200" step="0.1" value="25" required></label><label>Height cm<input name="height" type="number" min="1" max="200" step="0.1" value="10" required></label><label>Packed weight kg<input name="weight" type="number" min="0.1" max="30" step="0.01" placeholder="Required if fabric weight cannot be estimated"></label><label>Courier ID (optional)<input name="courier_id"></label><div class="fts__wide fts__notice">Creating a shipment can book a real Shiprocket shipment for the selected paid seller order. FabricTrad prevents duplicate booking and only fulfills this seller's mapped Shopify line items.</div><div class="fts__wide fts__actions"><button class="fts__primary">Create Shiprocket shipment</button><button id="fts-cancel-shipment" class="fts__secondary" type="button">Cancel</button></div></form><div class="fts__tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Courier</th><th>AWB</th><th>Status</th><th>Estimated delivery</th><th>Updated</th></tr></thead><tbody id="fts-shipments-body"></tbody></table></div><div id="fts-shipments-empty" class="fts__empty" hidden>No shipment records yet.</div></section>
